@startuml
title UC-FL-002 派发部门阶段任务 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "阶段所属部长" as A
boundary "接口:部长接口" as B
control "控制:派发部门阶段任务控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "F:流转任务" as F
participant "G:任务阶段" as G
participant "N:成员" as N
A -> B: 派发部门阶段任务(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 派发部门阶段任务(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> F: 派发阶段(部长、目标阶段、承接人、排班依据)
activate F
F -> G: 检查可开始(前序阶段完成情况)
G --> F: 可开始或等待前序
F -> G: 派发(部长、承接人、排班依据)
activate G
G -> N: 验证归属(阶段所属部门)
N --> G: 成员资格
G --> F: 唯一承接结果或拒绝原因
deactivate G
F --> C: 派发结果
deactivate F

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
